" - [#2]: Qi Rui and Wan Haoyi. Roving China Heavens\n"
" - [#3]: Su Song. *Xinyixiangfayao Star Map*\n"
" - [#4]: *Records of the Grand Historian*\n"
" - [#5]: *Book of Sui*\n"
" - [#6]: *History of Song*\n"
"\n"
"### External links\n"
"\n"
