"~emamajek/WGSN/IAU-CSN.txt)\n"
" - [#3]: [Uranometria 2000.0 Deep Sky Field Guide. ISBN: 0-943396-73-5]"
"(https://shopatsky.com/products/uranometria-2000-0-atlas-deep-sky-field-"
