" - [#5]: Hoffmann, Susanne M.: Hipparchs Himmelsglobus, Springer, "
"Wiesbaden / New York, 2017\n"
" - [#6]: Santiago Paolantonio, Beatriz García (2019). \"Uranometría "
"Argentina and the constellation boundaries\". Under One Sky: The IAU "
